odotengine/godot/pull/109043.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-20T23:15:21Z"},"body":"This adds the ability to **view** a resource's signals in the already existing Connections Dock.\r\n\r\nTechnically, anything inheriting from Object will be viewable. There is also support for connecting and disconnecting signals from a Resource to a Node's script in the current scene, but I couldn't manage to find a way that the resource was loaded in the current scene, so I decided to disable it by disabling the buttons to bring up the connect dialog.\r\n\r\nCloses godotengine/godot-proposals#7377\r\n\r\n<img width=\"825\" height=\"335\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fb0620d-407b-45de-b4cb-c90caff7b2ca\" />\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109043/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109043/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null